<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves ease to $3.499 bln-Nov 20.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves ease to $3.499 bln-Nov 20.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Friday said its hard currency reserves eased to $3.499 billion as of November 20 from $3.517 billion on November 13.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES	 Nov 20   Nov 13  Nov '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	    3.499    3.517   3.046</p>
<p>  Commercial banks		 1.338    1.230   1.590</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector	  4.838    4.747   4.636</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
